stage_b_reviewed_content.statement:
Let $\mathcal{C}$ be a category.
\begin{enumerate}
\item All limits and colimits exist in $\textit{PAb}(\mathcal{C})$.
\item All limits and colimits commute with taking sections over objects of
$\mathcal{C}$.
\end{enumerate}

